  "provenance": "hand-derived",
  "provenance_note": "Hand-derived from 301.0-B-4 \u00a73.5.1 (cases time-ascii-001 and -002 are the two examples printed there) and the grammar in docs/standards/time-codes.md \u00a75.1 (OI-29). Expected values computed by an independent Python model (regular shapes and Python's datetime calendar), written before the Rust codec.",
